robertson_wp, robertson_exclusions = benchmark_problem(
    :robertson, robertson_endpoint,
    (ordinary = robertson, stabilized_split = split_robertson, static = static_robertson),
)
print_work_table(robertson_wp, 16 * eps(Float64))
```

