## Harmonic oscillator

```julia; echo=false
oscillator_end = copy(oscillator.u0)
oscillator_end[1], oscillator_end[2] = -sin(1.0), cos(1.0)
oscillator_reference = TestSolution([1.0], [oscillator_end])
oscillator_wp, oscillator_exclusions = benchmark_problem(
    :oscillator, oscillator_reference, (partitioned = oscillator,),
)
print_work_table(oscillator_wp, 16 * eps(Float64); orders = oscillator_orders())
```

